      "node_type": "org.w3c.dom.Element.class"
  },
  "returns": [
     /* array of Element objects */
  ]
}
```

#### How to invoke it programmatically

Assuming you’re calling through whatever bridge your tooling provides (e.g., a REST endpoint, a scripting engine, or a native Java invocation), here’s a pseudo‑call:

```java
